1319
01:00:27.428 --> 01:00:29.697
An Oompa-what-now?

1320
01:00:29.730 --> 01:00:32.166
In fact, in Loompaland,
I am regarded
as something of a whopper.

1321
01:00:32.199 --> 01:00:34.001
They call me Lofty.

1322
01:00:34.034 --> 01:00:36.003
