that it may never
leave your mind.

1345
01:01:22.283 --> 01:01:23.717
Oh, I don't think
I wanna hear that.

1346
01:01:23.751 --> 01:01:24.852
Too late.

1347
01:01:24.885 --> 01:01:26.287
I've started dancing now.

1348
01:01:26.320 --> 01:01:28.088
Once we've started,
we can't stop, you see.

1349
01:01:30.391 --> 01:01:33.794
